  "description": "YOUR CITY, UNLOCKED Meet the all-new Vida E+ EX. Fully equipped, effortlessly powerful and built for riders who want it all. Weave through traffic and busy streets with instant, responsive power that moves with you, not against you. SyncDrive technology and an upgraded throttle give you a clean, confident start every time you pull away, while Cruise Mode lets you sit back and relax on longer journeys. Every pothole, kerb drop and rough road gets smoothed out beneath you, so you arrive feeling as fresh as when you left. Upright, stable and built for real city riding, the new Vida E+ EX handles the road, so you can enjoy the ride. YOUR CITY IS CALLING. IT’S TIME.",
